   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Replace across video\nOne constant identity for the whole take (tracked crop, the clip's full length).\n\n**Inputs**: Load Video `plate` (the shot) and `subject mask` (white = replace; any segmenter, saved as a\nvideo); Load Image `character` (the new character; for match-proportions the shoulders must be visible).\n\n**Head Size Mode**: `match character proportions` - set the SAME mode on H3 Subject Crop and H3 Family Presets.\n**Order**: crop around the subject (head room) -> structured prompt (Family Presets -> editable in Prompt\nEditor) -> Reference to Video (<Picture 1> character, <Video 1> cropped plate) -> latent mask from\nhead_room_masks -> Masked Replace -> sample -> decode -> Subject Uncrop with head_room_masks -> save.\n**Prompt**: Family Presets writes a fixed template; run once and the Prompt Editor shows it - type in it\nto send your edit instead (use_edited_text turns on; turn it off to take the template again).\n**Settings**: starting values (official H3 r2v template: res_multistep, simple, 20 steps, guider cfg 1);\nnot yet validated on H3 weights. Full guide: docs/character_replacement.md in the MiniMax H3 Suite."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "# Replace across video\nOne constant identity for the whole take (tracked crop, the clip's full length).\n\n**Inputs**: Load Video `plate` (the shot) and `subject mask` (white = replace; any segmenter, saved as a\nvideo); Load Image `character` (the new character; for match-proportions the shoulders must be visible).\n\n**Head Size Mode**: `match character proportions` - set the SAME mode on H3 Subject Crop and H3 Family Presets.\n**Order**: crop around the subject (head room) -> structured prompt (Family Presets -> editable in Prompt\nEditor) -> Reference to Video (<Picture 1> character, <Video 1> cropped plate) -> latent mask from\nhead_room_masks -> Masked Replace -> sample -> decode -> Subject Uncrop with head_room_masks -> save.\n**Prompt**: Family Presets writes a fixed template; run once and the Prompt Editor shows it - type in it\nto send your edit instead (use_edited_text turns on; turn it off to take the template again).\n**Settings**: starting values (official H3 r2v template: res_multistep, simple, 20 steps, guider cfg 1);\nnot yet validated on H3 weights. Full guide: docs/character_replacement.md in the MiniMax H3 Suite."
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
